---
---
<section aria-label="My role" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: var(--surface-page); color: #251F19; font-family: var(--font-text); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
  <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: calc(var(--content-max) + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) var(--gutter); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);">

    <div class="head" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--brand);">My role</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #251F19;">Where I sat on this project</h2>
      </div>

    </div>

    <blockquote class="pull">
      <p><span class="dim">This isn’t</span> requirements ownership. <span class="dim">It’s</span> interpretation and translation, <span class="dim">done alongside the team who owned the spec.</span></p>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="scope">
      <div class="scope__grid">
        <h3 class="scope__h">Scope, plainly stated</h3>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86);">I joined <strong>after</strong> requirement discussions had started, working from an <strong>existing SRS</strong> I did not author, with <strong>no prior banking experience</strong> going in.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.66);">My contribution was flows, wireframes, and UI patterns, not business or compliance logic.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="widget">
        <span class="widget__label">Role
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="widget__sub">UX Designer</span>
        <span class="widget__value">Leads · Users · Masters</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.pull{margin:0;padding:clamp(4px,1vw,8px) 0 clamp(4px,1vw,8px) clamp(20px,2.4vw,32px);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);max-width:960px}
.pull p{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,30px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#251F19}
.pull .dim{color:#948B81}
.scope{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,3.4vw,44px) clamp(64px,7vw,80px);margin-bottom:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:var(--accent);color:#FFFFFF}
.scope__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.4fr);gap:clamp(20px,3vw,40px)}
@media (max-width: 760px){.scope__grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
.scope__h{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(24px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#FFFFFF}
.scope strong{font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF}
.widget{position:absolute;left:clamp(24px,3.4vw,44px);bottom:-40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:220px;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:12px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D3E7E8;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -18px rgba(0,35,41,.35)}
.widget__label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#4C6367}
.widget__sub{font-size:12px;color:#7C9295}
.widget__value{margin-top:6px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#002329}
</style>
